# Microsoft / Hotmail / Outlook Account Credentials
#
# NOTE: If Two-Step Verification (2FA) is enabled on your Microsoft account,
# standard account passwords will not work for IMAP. You MUST generate and use
# an App Password:
# 1. Sign in to https://account.live.com/proofs/manage/additional
# 2. Under "App passwords", select "Create a new app password"
# 3. Paste the generated 16-character password below (without spaces)
HOTMAIL_USER=your_email@hotmail.com
HOTMAIL_PASS=your_app_password_here
